@b <https://example.org/lattice/mtp/legalruleml-cold2#>
@p lrmlmm=<http://docs.oasis-open.org/legalruleml/ns/v1.0/metamodel#>
@p ins=<https://www.nebularis.org/neuro-semantic/lattice/instrument#>
@p pty=<https://www.nebularis.org/neuro-semantic/lattice/party#>
%R Source fm mork:RDF lb "LegalRuleML deontic specifications"
%X
lrmlmm:Obligation RE
lrmlmm:Permission RE
lrmlmm:Prohibition RE
lrmlmm:Right RE
%T Concepts in Source
ObligationConcept C ra lrmlmm:Obligation
ObligationBearer C p lrmlmm:Bearer
ObligationAux C p lrmlmm:AuxiliaryParty
PermissionConcept C ra lrmlmm:Permission
PermissionBearer C p lrmlmm:Bearer
PermissionAux C p lrmlmm:AuxiliaryParty
ProhibitionConcept C ra lrmlmm:Prohibition
ProhibitionBearer C p lrmlmm:Bearer
RightConcept C ra lrmlmm:Right
RightBearer C p lrmlmm:Bearer
RightAux C p lrmlmm:AuxiliaryParty
%M Scheme md mork:ReviewMode lb "LegalRuleML deontic specifications to stated LATTICE relations" sdl [lrmlmm <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legalruleml/ns/v1.0/metamodel#>]
Role_T MD xt pty:Role c role
Role_T_Label M cb Role_T xr rdfs:label r rdfs:label
Obl MD f ObligationConcept xt ins:Term,ins:Template c obligation-term
Obl_Relation MD cb Obl xt ins:Obligation,ins:Template xr ins:arisesUnder c obligation
Obl_Activity M cb Obl_Relation xr ins:activity r rdfs:label
Obl_Obligor MD cb Obl_Relation tp Role_T f ObligationBearer xi ins:obligor
Obl_Obligee MD cb Obl_Relation tp Role_T f ObligationAux xi ins:obligee
Perm MD f PermissionConcept xt ins:Term,ins:Template c permission-term
Perm_Relation MD cb Perm xt ins:Permission,ins:Template xr ins:arisesUnder c permission
Perm_Activity M cb Perm_Relation xr ins:activity r rdfs:label
Perm_Holder MD cb Perm_Relation tp Role_T f PermissionBearer xi ins:holder
Perm_Counterparty MD cb Perm_Relation tp Role_T f PermissionAux xi ins:counterparty
Perm_Implied MD cb Perm_Relation xt ins:Prohibition,ins:Template xi ins:excepts ct "implied-prohibition/${rdfs:label}" n "Law I8: the permission excepts a prohibition on the same act, its obligor the holder."
Perm_Implied_Term MD cb Perm_Implied xt ins:Term,ins:Template xi ins:arisesUnder ct "implied-term/${rdfs:label}"
Perm_Implied_Activity M cb Perm_Implied xr ins:activity r rdfs:label
Perm_Implied_Obligor MD cb Perm_Implied tp Role_T f PermissionBearer xi ins:obligor
Perm_Implied_Obligee MD cb Perm_Implied tp Role_T f PermissionAux xi ins:obligee
Proh MD f ProhibitionConcept xt ins:Term,ins:Template c prohibition-term
Proh_Relation MD cb Proh xt ins:Prohibition,ins:Template xr ins:arisesUnder c prohibition
Proh_Activity M cb Proh_Relation xr ins:activity r rdfs:label
Proh_Obligor MD cb Proh_Relation tp Role_T f ProhibitionBearer xi ins:obligor
